Subject: [PATCH 05/50] Support files

Carry the dependency-compatible baseline over the actual upstream
source. This patch contains one reviewable part of the combined
historical changes; full original messages are retained in HISTORY.

Original-Commits: See the compatibility-baseline entries in HISTORY.

diff --git a/TODO b/TODO
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..d3bc137d8
--- /dev/null
+++ b/TODO
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+Fix issue on Windows with BRL-CAD art executable not working successfully
+
+Remove requirement to use Boost - much of current usage should be covered
+by newer C++ standards, and latest dependencies (OSL, etc.) appear to be
+moving away from Boost.
